    <title>1. The Batman effect describes a spontaneous event that triggers prosocial behavior.</title>
    <id>https://lzon.ca/trivia/1</id>
    <link href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s44184-025-00171-5"/>
    <published>2026-10-21T12:00:00Z</published>
    <updated>2026-10-21T12:00:00Z</updated>
    <author><name>Lzon</name></author>
    
    <content type="html" xml:base="https://lzon.ca/trivia/trivia-000001-batman/">
&lt;p&gt;In a study published in Nature, researchers found in their experiment that riders on public transit were more willing to give their seat to a pregnant woman when in the presence of a man dressed as Batman.&lt;/p&gt;
